          {
            "title": "Example: Create a big heading",
            "id": 59039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna a questa pagina web il titolo più grande.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rendi <code>Hello, World!</code> il titolo più grande e assegna a <code>Welcome</code> il secondo titolo più grande.</p><p>Usa tag di apertura e chiusura corrispondenti per ogni intestazione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>, <code>Welcome</code> e infine <code>&lt;/h2&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: opening tag",
            "id": 63940,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questa pagina web?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"3D Printers\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Easy to get started\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Fun to play with\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Unlimited creativity\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non c'è alcun tag di apertura <code>h1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I tag dei paragrafi non sono assemblati correttamente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Mancano alcuni tag di chiusura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non c'è alcun tag di apertura <code>h1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La pagina deve iniziare con un'intestazione, seguita da tre paragrafi. Quale problema impedisce di assemblare correttamente l'intestazione?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"3D Printers\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Easy to get started\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Fun to play with\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Unlimited creativity\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il primo tag dell'intestazione è un tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gli elementi paragrafo usano i tag di chiusura prima del testo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il testo dell'intestazione deve trovarsi in un elemento paragrafo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il primo tag dell'intestazione è un tag di chiusura.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 59583,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questi tag di enfasi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Purple Haze\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">C'è un segno <code>/</code> nel tag di apertura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Manca il tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non contengono alcun contenuto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">C'è un segno <code>/</code> nel tag di apertura.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il testo deve trovarsi all'interno di un solo elemento di enfasi. Perché il primo tag è sbagliato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Purple Haze\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Inizia con <code>&lt;/</code>, quindi è un tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usa il nome di tag sbagliato per l'enfasi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Posiziona il testo all'esterno di entrambi i tag</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Inizia con <code>&lt;/</code>, quindi è un tag di chiusura.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 8",
            "id": 59093,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il tag di apertura che definisce il testo come importante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dr. Amp's Gold Shovels\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Order now - \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"only $29.99\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;</code>, seguito da <code>strong</code> e infine <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Racchiudi <code>only $29.99</code> tra tag corrispondenti per contrassegnare il testo come importante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dr. Amp's Gold Shovels\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Order now: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"only $29.99\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Order now:\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>only $29.99</code> e infine <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 59083,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché il tag di interruzione di riga è un tag vuoto?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Perché non ha un tag di chiusura</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Perché non ha alcun effetto sulla struttura di una pagina web</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Perché non ha un tag di apertura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché non ha un tag di chiusura.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> tra due righe di testo. Perché non aggiungi <code>&lt;/br&gt;</code> subito dopo?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> è un tag vuoto e non ha un tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> è un tag heading</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Perché i tag vuoti non hanno un tag di apertura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> è un tag vuoto e non ha un tag di chiusura.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Text between the tags",
            "id": 67563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>Accept</code> sul pulsante scrivendo tra i tag di apertura e di chiusura.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"By clicking accept, you agree to helping a friend this weekend.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accept\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"No way!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Reject\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Accept</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai visualizzare <code>Accept</code> al primo pulsante e mantieni <code>No way!</code> sul secondo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"By clicking accept, you agree to helping a friend this weekend.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accept\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"No way!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Agree\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Reject\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Accept</code>, seguito da <code>No way!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Button tags",
            "id": 67567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
